<title>USA: Marriott to guarantee Renaissance debt.</title>
<headline>Marriott to guarantee Renaissance debt.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Renaissance Hotel Group NV said on Friday its parent, Marriott International Inc, has guaranteed the obligation of RHG Finance Corp, a subsidiary of Renaissance, under the existing $120 million 8-7/8 percent guaranteed notes due 2005.</p>
<p>Renaissance Hotel's existing guarantee of the notes remains in effect, the company said.</p>
<p>Renaissance Hotel became a subsidiary of Marriott on March 29, 1997, it said.</p>
</text>
